-## ProvenanceTag Minimum Schema
-
-```json
-{
-  "semantic_id": "indicator.ewm",
-  "version": 1,
-  "params": {"span": 3, "init": "first_value"},
-  "role": "ewm",
-  "tag_attached_by": "recipe_compiler"
-}
-```
